{
  "route": "/community-groups",
  "label": "Community Groups",
  "title": "Community Groups",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "At the conclusion of every Sunday service we send everyone out on mission, saying: “Go in peace to love and serve the Lord!”. "
            },
            {
              "text": "Then, during the week, St John’s people gather across the city to learn how to live out this mission in their daily lives.  "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "About Community Groups "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "While every group is unique, they all include:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Food"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Groups build relationships with one another and embody Christian unity by sharing dinner, nibbles, drinks, or dessert. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Reflection"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Prayer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Each group spends time coming before God in worship, thanksgiving, and petition. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Support"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Groups act as nuclear families of the church, caring for one another and helping one another in ways both spiritual and practical."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Interested in joining a community group?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "Please fill out the form below and one of the ministers will help find the right group for you."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
